{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": "-- Grafana --",
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "Operational launch-path dashboard for the local relaunch stack: launch-critical health/readiness probes, Prometheus target state, and main-api metrics that actually exist today.",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "Current launch-critical health and readiness probe state.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "displayMode": "color-background"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "probe_success{job=~\"wrfcoin-launch-health|wrfcoin-launch-websocket\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Launch Probe Status",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "__name__": true,
              "Time": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Status",
              "endpoint": "Endpoint",
              "layer": "Layer",
              "service": "Service"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "Only failing probes are shown here to keep triage focused.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "probe_success{job=~\"wrfcoin-launch-health|wrfcoin-launch-websocket\"} == 0",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Failing Probes",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "__name__": true,
              "Time": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Status",
              "endpoint": "Endpoint",
              "layer": "Layer",
              "service": "Service"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "Last HTTP status returned by each probe target.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 17,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "probe_http_status_code{job=~\"wrfcoin-launch-health|wrfcoin-launch-websocket\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Probe HTTP Status Codes",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "__name__": true,
              "Time": true,
              "instance": true,
              "job": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "HTTP Status",
              "endpoint": "Endpoint",
              "service": "Service"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "Current Prometheus scrape state for jobs that expose metrics directly.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "displayMode": "color-background"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                },
                "1": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "UP"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "up{job=~\"prometheus|wrfcoin-main-api|wrfcoin-blockchain-api\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Prometheus Target Health",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "__name__": true,
              "Time": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Status",
              "instance": "Instance",
              "job": "Job"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "Average main-api request rate split by status code.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status_code) (rate(wrfcoin_http_requests_total{job=\"wrfcoin-main-api\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status_code}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Main API Request Rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "Current active requests through the main API.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(wrfcoin_http_active_connections{job=\"wrfcoin-main-api\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Main API Active Requests",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "P95 latency for main-api requests based on existing Prometheus histograms.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "hidden",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(wrfcoin_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"wrfcoin-main-api\"}[5m])))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Main API p95 Latency",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "Process and runtime pressure for the main API service.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Resident Memory"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "bytes"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Event Loop p99"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{job=\"wrfcoin-main-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Resident Memory",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "nodejs_eventloop_lag_p99_seconds{job=\"wrfcoin-main-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Event Loop p99",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Main API Runtime Pressure",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "description": "This board intentionally shows health probes for compute-agent, compute-contribution, launch_api, Grafana, and Prometheus because those services do not all expose rich Prometheus metrics today.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 17
      },
      "id": 9,
      "options": {
        "content": "### Metrics gaps to keep in mind\n- `compute-agent` only exposes `/health`; the dashboard can show probe success and latency, not internal task counters.\n- `compute-contribution` is probed on `/ready`; it does not currently expose Prometheus-formatted service metrics.\n- `launch_api` is visible through `/health` and, when available, its direct `/metrics` scrape, but detailed launch-path instrumentation still needs future work.\n- Relaunch smoke matrix (`service start`, `health checks`, `contract gate`, `steady state`) is written to `relaunch-report.json`, not exported to Prometheus yet.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Metrics Gaps",
      "type": "text"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": [
    "wrfcoin",
    "launch",
    "relaunch",
    "operations"
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "WRF Launch Path Ops",
  "uid": "wrf-launch-path-ops",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
